  - model validation
abstract: >
  Lumped-parameter model of bolted-joint self-loosening in which a slow state
  (preload, embedding, creep, wear, nut rotation, surface damage) is integrated
  cycle by cycle with four loss mechanisms in parallel. The repository contains
  the engine, the GUI, the 205-curve validation corpus digitised from 28 published
  studies, the adopted per-rig configurations with provenance, the canonical
  validation store, and the generators that recompute every number of the
  companion paper and its software annex.
